Track 1: Sun Dial Grins
- Story & Context: Young Juna, then just a scrappy caravan hand, unearthed a curious brass sun dial, its surface etched with ancient, swirling symbols, amidst the wreckage of a sand-swallowed research outpost near the Glint Wastes, and when a sudden, furious solar storm struck, the dial didn't just tell time—it pulsed with an unsettling violet light, electromagnetically frying the delicate control board of her prized, newly salvaged Hammond B3, rendering it brilliantly, savagely detuned. "Sun dial grins, but my Hammond bleeds."
